meta {
  name: Job Digger API
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Origin: {{frontendUrl}}
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  NestJS API for Job Digger (web + Gmail outreach).

  Base URL is {{baseUrl}} (Local: http://localhost:8080).
  Session cookie name: jobdigger.sid

  Google OAuth cannot finish inside Bruno. Open GET Auth → Start Google OAuth in a browser,
  connect Gmail, then copy the jobdigger.sid cookie from localhost:8080 into Bruno's cookie jar
  (or send authenticated requests from the same host after a browser login).

  Run Contacts → List Contacts first to store {{contactId}} for Get Contact and Send Email.
}
